# Horizon Configuration

## Documentation

Use ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___search-docs___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ for detailed Horizon patterns and documentation covering configuration, supervisors, balancing, dashboard authorization, tags, notifications, metrics, and deployment.

For deeper guidance on specific topics, read the relevant reference file before implementing:

- ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___references/supervisors.md___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ covers supervisor blocks, balancing strategies, multi-queue setups, and auto-scaling
- ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___references/notifications.md___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ covers LongWaitDetected alerts, notification routing, and the ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___waits___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ config
- ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___references/tags.md___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ covers job tagging, dashboard filtering, and silencing noisy jobs
- ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___references/metrics.md___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ covers the blank metrics dashboard, snapshot scheduling, and retention config

